+
+Older runtimes compute expiry from `claimed_at` only and would reclaim claims
+that heartbeats keep alive, so this runtime must not share a center with them
+unless the hook enforces heartbeat expiry. Callers that read under
+`storage.lock()` should use `storage.read_snapshot()`; `storage.lock()` is now
+an optimistic transaction that may raise `StateConflictError`.
 
